{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_03",
  "title": "惶惑与冲动",
  "storyCode": "EA-3",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "30da613efec07b9c15d3eb01f11f7c32229e45bfc9c2c5f566254df62986eba6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g2_citystreets_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一只甲虫低低飞过黑暗弥漫的街巷。\n它奋力振翅，却只不过闯进了一片几乎无人踏足的废弃街区。\n纯金做的身躯太重，翅膀上的宝石也对飞翔无益。它飞了短短一点距离，就不得不趴在石板中间的缝隙处休息——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让你再跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓住了，抓住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抓住你那破虫子就快去帮我捡水晶！快滚进阴沟里了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这就来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，我要是帮你捡，你是不是得分我点什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "分，分！你先来帮我捡！水晶滚进阴沟里，你难道不心疼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我的好云兽，这下你是我的了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剑上的宝石......还好，还好，一个都没碰落......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”他们呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管他们干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "官僚把蛀虫藏进怀里，酷吏不厌其烦地看着泪滴一次又一次滑落。\n拷问者粗鲁地摆弄云兽的肢体，监察官举起那柄剑，仿佛手执生杀的权力......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵，真热闹啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我当然可以把这些财宝赐给你们，我的仆臣们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们喜欢这些东西到这种地步，要是不满足你们，不解风情的反倒是我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我把这些给了你们之后，你们又想从我手中拿走什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我猜猜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不知为何，原本断了头的小巷中凭空生出一条路来，更多璀璨夺目的东西朝着路的尽头涌去。\n人们已经无暇抚弄手里的东西了。\n他们把地上的财宝捡起来，塞进口袋，或是背在身上，连腰都来不及直起来，就奔向下一个闪闪发光的地方。\n没人关心这条路通往何方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "官僚",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......明天我就去多索雷斯，倒腾了那么多货，我早该给自己买点东西了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酷吏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......纳斯尔纱这帮乡巴佬，该再榨一榨他们的油水......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "监察官",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别忘了分我些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拷问者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等城里人真把“维多利亚间谍”送到我这儿来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，听听，你们贪图的何止是财宝啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "优渥的生活，高贵的地位，横流的物欲，生杀的权柄......你们都想要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不讨厌忠于自己欲望的人，你们要的东西，送人也没什么可惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可唯一不巧的是，你们是我的仆臣，而你们似乎比我还贪婪得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......再见，去你们该去的地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "财宝于无路处凭空铺成一条闪闪发光的路，送彻底癫狂的人群走出巢穴，走上大地......\n走向黑暗的来处，那残忍地张开大口的黑林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这一段，和您之前讲的东西，风格完全不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早就说过，观察、灵感、写作过程中废掉的文本，我会一股脑抛出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我真的能将这个故事完完整整地用统一的风格讲完，那我也不用在这里喝馊掉的啤酒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非要给故事一个结局的人是你，不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "的确如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，如果我非要把这一段当成您的创作，是不是可以说，前面那位布莉吉小姐被黑雾拒绝也算是创作？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......至少不比你硬塞到故事里的“放逐王”更“创作”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，接下来您要讲的，又到底是观察，还是创作呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你愿意，就自己去区分。你到底还想不想让我讲下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，当然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g10_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾玛她到底怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是轻微的营养不良，外加受了风寒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在黑林外边的时候，看起来可没病这么重啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多半是心病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打造雕像的铁要挨家挨户收集，人们为了节省燃料连灯都不愿意开，更别说食物了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她能押什么东西出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是粮店老板，所以......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但她也只是个粮店老板，一个人不可能做到这些。多半有人指使她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们还有提奥的事要问，没时间等她自己醒过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——嗬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾玛，你醒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尼亚——尼亚尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你带我走吧......你带我走吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，她还睡着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她好像在喊一个人的名字......尼亚尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“尼亚尔”......有这个署名给她寄过信，应该是亲近的人吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个人现在在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道，但这个人有段时间没给艾玛寄过信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尼亚尔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你骂我吧，打我也可以，只是别丢下我不管......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“官僚”让我运粮食，我就运......你死在战场上，我活着又有什么意思？我对别人好，又能怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“官僚”......是深池的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正城里那么多粮食，就运一车，不会有事的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正城里的粮食已经没有了，就算这一车运出去，也不会有事的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会有事的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们......还要叫醒她吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......为什么活下来的不是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么......为什么该死的维多利亚人......他们的孩子能活？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维多利亚人的......孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......嗬——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系，亲爱的——我会纠正它——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等着我，尼亚尔......等着我，亲爱的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呜......呜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我见不到你了，亲爱的！我见不到你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么，为什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杀死你的维多利亚人，他们已经被赶跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就连最后那个维多利亚坏种，也已经在我眼前......死掉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "担忧的居民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尼亚尔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾玛滚烫的额头上满是汗珠，连绵噩梦让她无意识地抓住身下的床单，浑身止不住地颤抖着。\n而房间里另外两个人同时站了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g2_citystreets_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宵禁已经开始一段时间了，我们现在真的能自由行动吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我带着你。如果黑雾真的要吞噬我们中的任何一个，就让它来试试看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，堡垒那边有人走过来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像是深池的人，是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他怎么了？好像丢了魂一样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉芙希妮小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉芙希妮小姐，现在，回到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”先生，出什么事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今晚没有任何事发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”先生，城中粮荒的事情已经有线索了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这间粮店的老板艾玛受“官僚”指使，一直在把粮食偷偷运出纳斯尔纱走私。如果动作够快，我们还能把粮食追回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是“官僚”？我早该想到他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是太晚了，一切都太晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么太晚了？难道你知道了粮食的下落？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不是粮食，而是......\n我。我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉芙希妮小姐，感谢您的消息，但我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”先生，到底出了什么事？告诉我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，今晚没有任何事发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道到底出了什么事，才能让你这样的人，为了一个理想不惜夺走那么多人生命的......战士，变成现在这个样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你和深池，你们踩着那么多人的尸骸建立这个国度，就是为了把自己的同胞困在城中饿死吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，拉芙希妮小姐，决不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢您的消息，我......我会自己去解决这个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，以后别再提起深池这个词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，既然我已经答应您，今晚您就无论如何不要再踏上街道一步，更不要像这样，带着无关紧要的人破坏宵禁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "校官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是为了你们好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮还想说些什么，校官却不想再回应。\n他转了个身，拖着沉重的步伐，往城外的方向走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们真的要像他说的一样躲起来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，提奥的事应该立刻告诉涅梅丝。你知道她住哪里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "离这里有些远，几乎在整个纳斯尔纱的另一头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们这就过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g2_citystreets_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅梅丝家就在前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一路顺利，看来今晚雾气没有渗进城里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅梅丝，你在家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅梅丝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，涅梅丝不是说她晚上要参加深池的庆功会吗？难道她还没回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”刚刚是从堡垒的方向往外走，庆功会应该结束了才对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉芙希妮小姐......布莉吉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮正想开口，忽然对上了涅梅丝的眼睛。\n她的双眼甚至比刚刚的校官更加无神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅梅丝，到底怎么了，难道庆功会上出了什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，今天晚上没有任何事情发生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你们怎么在这里？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，快进屋！今晚千万别在街上逗留！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g8_blackforest_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在涅梅丝手忙脚乱地拉着拉芙希妮和布莉吉进屋的时候，校官已经走出了纳斯尔纱。\n他走入林中，走向黑暗，一直走进黑雾的最深处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g9_blackforest_inside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "片刻之后，先前被运出纳斯尔纱的粮食从黑林中缓缓现出形迹。\n它们将在天亮前回到纳斯尔纱的农业地块。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g1_citystreets_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "粮荒在天亮后得到了一定程度的缓解，校官却没有从黑林中回来，尽管这没有得到任何人的关心。\n那些奇迹般地出现在农业地块，随后流向各条街上的粮店的粮食，比真正能解决问题所需的数量少了不止一点。\n而那一夜后就再也没能回来的人，尽管城里的人还不知道，却绝不仅仅只有一个校官。\n无论如何，太阳无情地再次爬到人们头顶。\n红龙和离群的守灵人走上街头，震惊地看着那些已成常态的厮打与攻讦逐渐演化成更激烈的伤害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而游牧人敲响了铁匠的门，她正要为他带来一个不幸的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
